{{/*
tinkerbell.envRenames maps, as YAML, each environment variable Tinkerbell deprecated to the one
that replaced it. Value keys such as deployment.envs.dhcp.enabled derive the old names, and the
deprecated name wins when both are set, so the chart renders the current names instead.
It is cmd/tinkerbell/flag's deprecatedNames as environment variables; a test there keeps them equal.
*/}}
